  "details": "I was talking with someone new to VRC regarding the VRC desktop controls, and how the sprinting system worked on desktop. After a little thinking, I realized that it was a little weird for controllers or anything with a stick to always move at top speed without a sprint button, but for WASD controls to always move slower needing a sprint button. I wonder what an option to be always running & then change the sprint bind into a walk button would work out? Alternatively, the sprint button could also just become a toggle instead of a hold.",
